# Links that the link check of this repository skips, one regular expression per
# line, each with its reason above it. The rules of every repository are in lychee.toml.

# The data of the dashboard, which only the Dashboard workflow publishes after the merge
# that adds it; its deploy job asks for each file after every deployment.
^https://dennis-otto\.github\.io/repo-blueprint/dashboard/(repos\.json|releases\.atom)$

# The page for owners of their own, which only the Docs workflow publishes after the
# merge that adds it; #314 removes this entry once the website has it.
^https://dennis-otto\.github\.io/repo-blueprint/(de/)?own-account/$
